{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_017kth0292_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_017kth0292_1000_p", "source_sha256": "4ff516edfe5f0c12e05a46c6a8140b4e3aa5280cbdbc9083c55052f460138607", "ja": "（琴葉が机に向かって、何かしている。\n次の撮影に向けてのキャラ作りだろうか……）", "zh": "（琴叶正坐在桌前做些什么。\n是在为下一次拍摄塑造角色吧……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_017kth0292_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_017kth0292_1001_017kth", "source_sha256": "30454843a330942dfc87062693b51b6e1d79d4f070242c9fd2651161f85e5cba", "ja": "えーっと……ここは、否定の反対の意味だから……。\n訳すと……こう、かな？", "zh": "呃……这里是表示否定的反义，所以……翻译过来……应该是这样吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_017kth0292_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_017kth0292_1002_p", "source_sha256": "8fd916731b68a028c4e94a482d57fcdd2f22eafea6796da3192c4f09c0b50ee4", "ja": "琴葉、お疲れさま。\n一生懸命、何してるんだ？", "zh": "琴叶，辛苦了。\n这么拼命是在做什么呢？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_017kth0292_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_017kth0292_1003_017kth", "source_sha256": "6a63382b3f9dee6e93f78a52f104b9e472f88fae566d267eea13c51779b5798a", "ja": "{$P$}、お疲れさまです。\n今度、英語の小テストがあって。ちょっと勉強を……。", "zh": "{$P$}，辛苦了。\n接下来要进行一次英语小测验，所以我正在稍微复习一下……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_017kth0292_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_017kth0292_1004_017kth", "source_sha256": "87f9f86c14e2d91e1a8fefc88a07446e03fa06c34c68db746ca6f2d1690e815d", "ja": "次の撮影で演じる生徒会長は、勉強のできる役です。\n役に近づくために、私も成績をキープしないと！", "zh": "下一次拍摄中要饰演的学生会长，是个学习很好的角色。\n为了更贴近角色，我也得保持好成绩才行！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_017kth0292_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_017kth0292_1005_p", "source_sha256": "305f38c16e32d014d4b308785cbb3f46bfc8899d6c0e6d069cb3066960772380", "ja": "さすがだな。俺も、琴葉と同じクラスだったら、\nもっと真面目に勉強してたかもしれないな……。", "zh": "真不愧是你啊。要是我也和琴叶在同一个班，说不定会更认真地学习吧……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_017kth0292_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_017kth0292_1006_017kth", "source_sha256": "48fce86eeb7f39ee01e101c47e649d8604a550218bbdcc7d4f1d50318d4687cc", "ja": "えっ！　{$P$}って……\n不真面目な生徒だったんですか！？　い、意外です。", "zh": "诶！{$P$}原来是……不认真学习的学生吗！？真、真意外。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_017kth0292_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_017kth0292_1007_p", "source_sha256": "a96e30e25452f441b1e1a713d1e387583d617f6979dd52aae1e783b7a93bc564", "ja": "ははっ。テストの前日によく部屋の掃除してたっけ。\n今更だけど、ちゃんと勉強しとくんだったって思うよ。", "zh": "哈哈。记得我以前经常在考试前一天打扫房间来着。虽然现在才这么想，但当时真该好好学习的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_017kth0292_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_017kth0292_1008_017kth", "source_sha256": "305ec1bd16a5b26d527ae111195f9bcc5416b375a1ef4432e153aa78e7302b4e", "ja": "不真面目って、そういう……ふふっ。\nあの……よかったら、一緒に勉強しませんか？", "zh": "你说的“不认真”，就是指这个……呵呵。\n那个……如果你不介意，要不要一起学习？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_017kth0292_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_017kth0292_1009_p", "source_sha256": "692c198123b6468681086360deaa5158e9dfde1b30e9f77837cfe8e34f5aa7bf", "ja": "えっ？　でもテストの勉強中なんだろう？\n俺がいたら邪魔じゃないか？", "zh": "诶？可是你不是正在复习考试吗？\n有我在的话，不会打扰到你吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_017kth0292_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_017kth0292_1010_017kth", "source_sha256": "d78c562edc2630e81b4f3cc2858596dc900dec9fe2929fb4b1948380685d464a", "ja": "いえ、邪魔だなんて！　誰かと一緒の方が楽しく\n覚えられますから。じゃあ、最初は簡単なのを……。", "zh": "不，怎么会觉得打扰呢！和别人一起学会更有趣，也更容易记住。那就先从简单的开始……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_017kth0292_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_017kth0292_1011_p", "source_sha256": "e486d1015007def9df44ede6668848c8dc2b77adf51801326802e8e992c4f903", "ja": "（琴葉の小テストと役作りの力になれたかな。\n……しかし、高校生の問題は難しい。はあ～）", "zh": "（不知道有没有帮上琴叶的小测验和角色塑造的忙。\n……不过，高中生的题目真难。唉——）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
